tions","neural-simulator","2D-platformer","ICML-2024","Project source",[92],{"_51":90,"_25":93},"https://arxiv.org/abs/2402.15391","Why it belongs here","Combines a spatiotemporal video tokenizer, autoregressive dynamics, and a latent action model into generative interactive environments. Users can begin with an image or sketch and explore frame by frame. The ICML 2024 contribution centers on learning control without ground-truth action labels. Dynamics remain implicit in the model, without editable or queryable game rule programs.","detail","guidance","Resource type","Paper","Category","category","lead","summary","name","world","paper",[85,86,87,88,89],[105],[111,105],2024,"2d",{"_113":114},"documents",{"_115":116,"_117":118},"en",[120,124,125,126,123,127,128,129,130,131,132,133,134,135,136,137,138,139,140,141,142,143,144,145,146,147,148,149,150,151,152,153,154,155,156,157,158,122,159,121,160,161,162,163,164,165,166,167,168,169,170,171,172,173,174,175,176,177,178,179,180],"zh",[119,120,121,122,123],"reading-guide","practical-guide","level-design-skill","deployment","publishing-platforms","tutorials-and-demos","coding-agent-game-code","game-testing-library","agents-notes","engines-notes","game-ai-notes","cadle-repositories","world-model-notes","research-index","production-research-notes","engine-operation-contracts","production-work-orders","studio-production-case-studies","native-operation-details","production-debugging-contracts","production-coverage-gaps","generative-tools-research","generative-api-boundaries","generation-delivery-contracts","asset-validation-contracts","asset-selection-feedback","visual-evidence-research","visual-feedback-mechanisms","game-development-evaluation","benchmark-reproducibility","gameplay-state-contracts","agent-interface-evidence","catalog-review-coverage","source-revision-notes","community-case-research","overview","catalog","contributing","media-sources","icon-sources","content-model","skills/level-design/SKILL","skills/level-desi